#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Graphics Drivers"
msgstr "图形驱动程序"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"_**abstract**: Identify the GPU, the port providing a driver for it, install "
"it, then enable it to run at subsequent boot with man:sysrc[8]._"
msgstr "__**摘要**：识别 GPU，找到为其提供驱动程序的 port 并安装，然后使用 man:sysrc[8] 启用驱动程序，使其在后续启动时运行。__"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:85
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before FreeBSD can render a graphical environment, it needs a kernel module "
"to drive the graphics processor.  Graphics drivers are a fast-moving, cross-"
"platform target, which is why this is developed and distributed separately "
"from the FreeBSD base system."
msgstr "在 FreeBSD 能够呈现图形环境之前，需要一个内核模块来驱动图形处理器。图形驱动程序发展迅速且面向多个平台，因此它们与 FreeBSD 基本系统分开开发和分发。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:89
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The following table shows the different graphics processors supported by "
"FreeBSD, their corresponding module, and which port provides it:"
msgstr "下表列出了 FreeBSD 支持的不同图形处理器、对应的模块，以及提供该模块的 port："

