#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:133
#, fuzzy
msgid "There are several generations of driver technologies supported."
msgstr "支持多代驱动程序技术。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:137
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Direct Rendering drivers allowing PRIME offloading.  PRIME allows for "
"multiple providers of graphics processing to coexist.  PRIME is described "
"further in <<x-config-gpu>>."
msgstr "支持 PRIME 卸载的直接渲染驱动程序。PRIME 允许多个图形处理提供方共存。有关 PRIME 的更多说明，请参阅 <<x-config-gpu>>。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:142
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kernel Modesetting (crossref:glossary[kms-glossary,KMS])  This allows the "
"driver to directly specify the display mode.  This is required to support "
"suspend and resume when using the man:vt[4] console driver."
msgstr "内核模式设置（crossref:glossary[kms-glossary,KMS]）  该功能允许驱动程序直接指定显示模式。使用 man:vt[4] 控制台驱动程序时，这是支持挂起和恢复所必需的。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"User Modesetting The oldest class of drivers is still supported, however "
"they may only be used with man:sc[4] console and older versions of the man:"
"Xorg[1] graphical environment."
msgstr "用户模式设置 最早一类驱动程序仍受支持，但只能与 man:sc[4] 控制台以及较旧版本的 man:Xorg[1] 图形环境配合使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:150
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The following command can be used to identify which graphics processor is "
"installed in the system:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令识别系统中安装的图形处理器："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:154
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:559
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% pciconf -lv | grep -B3 display\n"
msgstr "% pciconf -lv | grep -B3 display\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:157
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:184
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:562
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:625
#, fuzzy
msgid "The output should be similar to the following:"
msgstr "输出应类似于以下内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:164
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"vgapci1@pci0:0:2:0:     class=0x030000 rev=0x0c hdr=0x00 vendor=0x8086 device=0x46a6 subvendor=0x1028 subdevice=0x0b29\n"
"    vendor     = 'Intel Corporation'\n"
"    device     = 'Alder Lake-P GT2 [Iris Xe Graphics]'\n"
"    class      = display\n"
msgstr "vgapci1@pci0:0:2:0:     class=0x030000 rev=0x0c hdr=0x00 vendor=0x8086 device=0x46a6 subvendor=0x1028 subdevice=0x0b29\n    vendor     = 'Intel Corporation'\n    device     = 'Alder Lake-P GT2 [Iris Xe Graphics]'\n    class      = display\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions on installing and enabling these drivers are in the "
"subsequent subsections."
msgstr "后续小节将详细介绍如何安装和启用这些驱动程序。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:175
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the graphics processor is not supported by Intel(R), AMD(R), or NVIDIA(R) "
"drivers, then SCFB or VESA modules should be used.  SCFB module must be used "
"when booting in UEFI mode.  VESA module must be used when booting in BIOS "
"mode."
msgstr "如果图形处理器不受 Intel(R)、AMD(R) 或 NVIDIA(R) 驱动程序支持，则应使用 SCFB 或 VESA 模块。以 UEFI 模式启动时必须使用 SCFB 模块；以 BIOS 模式启动时必须使用 VESA 模块。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:177
#, fuzzy
msgid "This command can be used to check the booting mode:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令检查启动模式："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:181
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% sysctl machdep.bootmethod\n"
msgstr "% sysctl machdep.bootmethod\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:188
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "machdep.bootmethod: UEFI\n"
msgstr "machdep.bootmethod: UEFI\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:192
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Intel(R) Graphics"
msgstr "Intel(R) 图形"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:graphics/drm-kmod[] package indirectly provides a range of "
"kernel modules for use with Intel(R) Graphics.  Recent versions of these "
"modules can be used in conjunction with other graphics processors in PRIME "
"with no special configuration."
msgstr "package:graphics/drm-kmod[] 软件包间接提供了一系列可用于 Intel(R) 图形的内核模块。这些模块的近期版本可以与其他图形处理器搭配用于 PRIME，无需特殊配置。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:201
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Intel(R) Graphics driver can be installed by executing the following "
"command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令即可安装 Intel(R) 图形驱动程序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:205
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:231
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install drm-kmod\n"
msgstr "# pkg install drm-kmod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:209
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then add the module to [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# file, by executing the "
"following command:"
msgstr "然后执行以下命令，将该模块添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 文件中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:213
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=i915kms\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=i915kms\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:216
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "AMD(R) Graphics"
msgstr "AMD(R) 图形"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:224
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:graphics/drm-kmod[] package indirectly provides kernel modules "
"for a range of AMD(R) Graphics processors.  The modules `amdgpu` or "
"`radeonkms` can be used depending the generation of the hardware.  The "
"FreeBSD project maintains a link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/Graphics/AMD-GPU-"
"Matrix[AMD graphics support matrix] showing support levels and to determine "
"which driver must be used."
msgstr "package:graphics/drm-kmod[] 软件包间接提供了一系列适用于 AMD(R) 图形处理器的内核模块。根据硬件代际，可以使用 `amdgpu` 或 `radeonkms` 模块。FreeBSD 项目维护了 link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/Graphics/AMD-GPU-Matrix[AMD 图形支持矩阵]，其中列出了支持级别，并说明应使用哪个驱动程序。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:227
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The AMD(R) Graphics drivers can be installed by executing the following "
"command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令即可安装 AMD(R) 图形驱动程序："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:235
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enable the current module by adding it to the [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# "
"file, executing the following command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令，将当前使用的模块添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 文件中以启用它："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:239
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=amdgpu\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=amdgpu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:244
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For older graphics (pre-HD7000/Tahiti), instead enable the legacy module by "
"adding it to the [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# file, executing the following "
"command:"
msgstr "对于较旧的图形硬件（HD7000/Tahiti 之前），请改为将旧版模块添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 文件中以启用它："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:248
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=radeonkms\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=radeonkms\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:251
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "NVIDIA"
msgid "NVIDIA(R) Graphics"
msgstr "NVIDIA"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:257
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"NVIDIA(R) produces standalone or discrete graphics processors, and provides "
"a proprietary driver for FreeBSD.  The FreeBSD Ports Collection provides "
"over a decade of drivers for supporting generations of NVIDIA graphics."
msgstr "NVIDIA(R) 生产独立或离散图形处理器，并为 FreeBSD 提供专有驱动程序。FreeBSD Ports Collection 提供了十多年来支持不同代际 NVIDIA 图形硬件的驱动程序。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:260
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Administrators should install the latest driver supported by their hardware."
msgstr "管理员应安装其硬件支持的最新驱动程序。"

