#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:296
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The latest NVIDIA(R) Graphics driver can be installed by running the "
"following command:"
msgstr "运行以下命令即可安装最新的 NVIDIA(R) 图形驱动程序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:300
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install nvidia-drm-kmod\n"
msgstr "# pkg install nvidia-drm-kmod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:304
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To enable the driver, add the module to [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# file, by "
"executing the following command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令，将该模块添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 文件中以启用驱动程序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:308
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia-drm\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia-drm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:311
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is the direct rendering crossref:glossary[kms-glossary,KMS] driver."
msgstr "这是直接渲染 crossref:glossary[kms-glossary,KMS] 驱动程序。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:315
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kernel modesetting is the option to set the graphics mode in the kernel.  "
"Enable it for subsequent boots with the following man:loader.conf[5] tunable:"
msgstr "内核模式设置是在内核中设置图形模式的选项。使用以下 man:loader.conf[5] 可调参数为后续启动启用此功能："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:319
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "hw.nvidiadrm.modeset=\"1\"\n"
msgstr "hw.nvidiadrm.modeset=\"1\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:323
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both PRIME and crossref:wayland[wayland-synopsis,Wayland] require kernel "
"modesetting."
msgstr "PRIME 和 crossref:wayland[wayland-synopsis,Wayland] 都需要内核模式设置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:327
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Prior versions of the driver do not support Direct Rendering.  Instead use "
"the modesetting module, by executing the following command:"
msgstr "较早版本的驱动程序不支持直接渲染。请执行以下命令改用模式设置模块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:330
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia-modeset\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia-modeset\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:336
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If requiring Nvidia drivers prior to 390, note that they do not support "
"kernel modesetting, and thus they must be used with the legacy man:sc[4] "
"console driver, and a package:x11/xorg-server[] version prior to 1.20."
msgstr "如果需要使用 390 之前版本的 Nvidia 驱动程序，请注意这些版本不支持内核模式设置，因此必须与旧版 man:sc[4] 控制台驱动程序以及 1.20 之前版本的 package:x11/xorg-server[] 配合使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:338
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable them in [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# with the following command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令，在 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 中启用这些驱动程序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:342
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia\n"
msgstr "# sysrc kld_list+=nvidia\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:351
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some graphic cards will need special firmware that needs to be downloaded "
"for the device to work properly.  The man:fwget[8] utility can download and "
"install the necessary files under [.filename]#/boot/firmware#.  man:fwget[8] "
"will scan the 'PCI' devices and download the firmware for those devices that "
"need it."
msgstr "某些显卡需要下载专用固件才能正常工作。man:fwget[8] 工具可以下载并将所需文件安装到 [.filename]#/boot/firmware# 中。man:fwget[8] 会扫描“PCI”设备，并下载需要固件的设备所需的固件。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:353
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "The X Window System"
msgid "X Window System Overview"
msgstr "X Window系统"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:363
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The X Window System is the heritage graphical stack for UNIX(R) platforms, "
"supporting the latest technologies while maintaining support for generations "
"of applications.  Applications, including the components of the desktop, are "
"hosted by the man:Xorg[1] server.  This system is network aware and its "
"various components can interoperate across networks."
msgstr "X Window 系统是 UNIX(R) 平台沿用至今的图形技术栈，在支持最新技术的同时，也兼容多代应用程序。包括桌面组件在内的应用程序由 man:Xorg[1] 服务器承载。该系统支持网络，其各个组件可以通过网络相互协作。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:365
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Installing The X.org Server"
msgstr "安装 X.org 服务器"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:370
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"_**abstract**: The package:x11/xorg[X.org] server must be installed to host "
"the crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktop].  Users must be added to the "
"`video` group to use it._"
msgstr "__**摘要**：必须安装 package:x11/xorg[X.org] 服务器来承载 crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,桌面]。用户必须加入 `video` 组才能使用该服务器。__"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:374
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once a graphics driver is installed and enabled, the X.org server can be "
"installed as a meta-package, or compiled locally with the ports tree."
msgstr "安装并启用图形驱动程序后，可以将 X.org 服务器作为元软件包安装，也可以使用 ports tree 在本地编译。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:377
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The binary package can be installed quickly but with fewer options for "
#| "customization:"
msgid ""
"The full meta-package can be installed quickly but with fewer options for "
"customization:"
msgstr "使用Binary套件的安装速度较快，但可用的自定义选项较少："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:381
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install xorg\n"
msgstr "# pkg install xorg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:388
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This installation results in the complete X Window System being installed, "
"including a traditional window manager, man:twm[1], and surrounding "
"traditional desktop suite.  Most users will want to install and configure a "
"contemporary crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktop] of their choice."
msgstr "此安装会安装完整的 X Window 系统，包括传统窗口管理器 man:twm[1] 以及配套的传统桌面套件。大多数用户会希望安装并配置自己选择的现代 crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,桌面]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:392
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The current user must be a member of the `video` group to run a graphical "
"environment.  To add a user to the `video` group, execute the following "
"command:"
msgstr "当前用户必须属于 `video` 组才能运行图形环境。执行以下命令即可将用户添加到 `video` 组："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:396
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pw groupmod video -m username\n"
msgstr "# pw groupmod video -m username\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:401
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To run the X Window System, use man:startx[1] from package:x11/xinit[], or "
"install and configure a display manager to start a graphical login on boot."
msgstr "要运行 X Window System，请使用 package:x11/xinit[] 中的 man:startx[1]，或安装并配置显示管理器，以便在启动时启动图形登录界面。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:408
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A smaller version of the X Window System suitable for experienced users is "
"available in package:x11/xorg-minimal[].  Most of the documents, libraries, "
"and applications will not be installed.  Some applications require these "
"additional components to function."
msgstr ""
"较精简版本的X系统适合给有经验的使用者使用，可至<package>x11/xorg-minimal</"
"package>取得。这个版本就不会安装大多数的文件、函数库以及应用程序，而部份应用"
"程序会需要这些额外的元件才能运作。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:411
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Manual Configuration"
msgid "X.org Configuration"
msgstr "手动配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:417
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"_**abstract**: If the defaults for the monitor or input devices, are not "
"satisfactory, crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktops] include GUIs for "
"configuring them, or they can be configured manually._"
msgstr "__**摘要**：如果显示器或输入设备的默认设置不合适，crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktops] 中包含用于配置它们的图形界面，也可以手动配置。__"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:422
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The X.org server supports most common graphics processors, monitors, and "
"input devices.  First, try the defaults.  This subsection provides an "
"overview of their configuration."
msgstr "X.org 服务器支持大多数常见的图形处理器、显示器和输入设备。首先尝试使用默认设置。本小节概述了它们的配置方法。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:424
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "XDM Configuration Files"
msgid "X.org Configuration Files"
msgstr "XDM 配置文件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:430
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Historically, the X.org server was configured with files in [.filename]#/usr/"
"local/etc/X11/#.  This is still supported for edge cases, but conflicts with "
"dynamic autoconfiguration."
msgstr "过去，X.org 服务器通过 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/# 中的文件进行配置。现在仍支持这种方式以应对特殊情况，但它会与动态自动配置冲突。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:434
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Do not create configuration for the X.org server in [.filename]#xorg.conf# "
"or run `Xorg -configure` unless automatic configuration fails."
msgstr ""
"显卡、显示器以及输入装置会自动侦测，无须任何手动设置。除非自动设置失败，否则"
"请勿建立<filename>xorg.conf</filename>或执行<option>-configure</option>步骤。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:440
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"X.org server looks in several directories for configuration files.  [."
"filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/# is the *recommended* directory for these "
"files on FreeBSD.  Using this directory helps keep application files "
"separate from operating system files."
msgstr ""
"<application>Xorg</application>会查看数个目录来寻找配置文件，在FreeBSD较建议"
"使用<filename>/usr/local/etc/X11/</filename>来存放这些配置文件，使用这个目录"
"可以帮助将应用程序文件与操作系统文件分离。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:445
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is easier to use multiple files that each configure a specific setting "
"than the traditional single [.filename]#xorg.conf#.  These files are stored "
"in the [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/# subdirectory."
msgstr ""
"使用多档，每一个文件只设定一个指定项目会较传统使用单一<filename>xorg.conf</"
"filename>设定来的简单。这些文件会存放在主配置文件目录下的<filename>xorg.conf."
"d/</filename>子目录，完整路径通常为<filename>/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/"
"</filename>。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:447
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Manual Configuration"
msgid "Graphics Configuration"
msgstr "手动配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:454
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Direct rendering provides the ability to seamlessly use a discrete graphics "
"processor (dGPU) alongside an integrated graphics processor (iGPU), called "
"PRIME.  The drivers will automatically offload intensive tasks to the dGPU "
"when required, and power it down when able."
msgstr "直接渲染支持将独立图形处理器（dGPU）与集成图形处理器（iGPU）无缝配合使用，这称为 PRIME。驱动程序会在需要时自动将高强度任务卸载到 dGPU，并在条件允许时关闭它以节省电量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:457
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To launch applications on the more powerful GPU in PRIME, use the "
"`DRI_PRIME=1` environment variable."
msgstr "要通过 PRIME 在性能更强的 GPU 上启动应用程序，请使用环境变量 `DRI_PRIME=1`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:461
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If multiple graphics drivers are conflicting, the driver for the graphics "
"processor can be specified in the [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/"
"# directory."
msgstr ""
"在新配置文件调整与测试过后，便可分开成较小的文件放置到正常的位置<filename>/"
"usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/</filename>。"

