#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Manual Configuration"
msgid "Input Configuration"
msgstr "手动配置"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:710
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:Xorg[1] server provides the package:x11/libinput[] library, a cross-"
"platform effort to support all touch, pointing, and keyboard devices under a "
"unified library.  Unless specified otherwise, this is loaded automatically."
msgstr "man:Xorg[1] 服务器提供 package:x11/libinput[] 库，这是一个跨平台项目，旨在通过统一的库支持所有触摸设备、指点设备和键盘设备。除非另有指定，否则该库会自动加载。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:715
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Individual device settings for man:libinput[4] can be tuned in the crossref:"
"desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktop's] GUI, or manually with package:x11/"
"xinput[xinput] and package:x11/setxkbmap[setxkbmap]."
msgstr "可以在 crossref:desktop[desktop-synopsis,desktop's] 图形界面中调整 man:libinput[4] 的单个设备设置，也可以使用 package:x11/xinput[xinput] 和 package:x11/setxkbmap[setxkbmap] 手动调整。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:721
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, there are older, lightweight, individual drivers for specific "
"input devices available in the package:x11-drivers[] category named x11/xf86-"
"input-[foo].  This approach requires manual configuration of the X.org "
"server.  Both are described in this subsection."
msgstr "此外，package:x11-drivers[] 类别中还提供了较旧、轻量且针对特定输入设备的独立驱动程序，名称为 x11/xf86-input-[foo]。这种方法需要手动配置 X.org 服务器。本小节将介绍这两种方法。"

#. type: Title ====
