#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:804
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"_**abstract**: Additional fonts can be installed from the package:x11-"
"fonts[] category or placed in [.filename]#~/.fonts#.  They are available "
"immediately to modern applications.  Configuration for older applications is "
"available and described as well._"
msgstr "__**摘要**：可以从 package:x11-fonts[] 类别安装其他字体，或将字体放在 [.filename]#~/.fonts# 中。现代应用程序可以立即使用这些字体。本文也介绍了旧版应用程序的相关配置。__"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:809
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The X Window System provides the X FreeType interface library (man:Xft[3]) "
"to render vector or outline fonts, as well as the traditional X Logical Font "
"Description system maintaining compatibility with generations of "
"applications and fonts."
msgstr "X Window System 提供 X FreeType 接口库（man:Xft[3]），用于渲染矢量或轮廓字体；同时还提供传统的 X 逻辑字体描述系统，以兼容多代应用程序和字体。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:811
#, fuzzy
msgid "There are primarily two types of fonts users will be interested in:"
msgstr "用户主要会关注以下两种字体："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:813
#, fuzzy
msgid "OpenType fonts or TrueType(R) fonts are for displaying on a screen."
msgstr "OpenType 字体或 TrueType(R) 字体用于屏幕显示。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:814
#, fuzzy
msgid "Adobe(R) PostScript(R) Type 1 fonts are for printing to paper."
msgstr "Adobe(R) PostScript(R) Type 1 字体用于打印到纸张上。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:816
#, fuzzy
msgid "These are both vector or outline fonts, there are also bitmap fonts."
msgstr "这两种都是矢量或轮廓字体，此外还有点阵字体。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:820
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD Ports Collection includes a wide and growing catalog of free, "
"high quality fonts available for installation in the package:x11-fonts[] "
"category."
msgstr "FreeBSD Ports Collection 在 package:x11-fonts[] 类别中提供了种类丰富且不断扩充的高质量免费字体，可供安装。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:825
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"System-wide font packages installed from the ports collection live in `[."
"filename]#/usr/local/share/fonts/#`.  Fonts for a single user can be placed "
"in `[.filename]#~/.fonts/#`, or `[.filename]#~/.local/share/fonts/#`."
msgstr "从 Ports Collection 安装的系统级字体包位于 `[.filename]#/usr/local/share/fonts/#`。单个用户的字体可以放在 `[.filename]#~/.fonts/#` 或 `[.filename]#~/.local/share/fonts/# 中。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:829
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Fonts in either directory or subdirectories will be available for immediate "
"use when the font information cache is rebuilt.  To trigger this manually, "
"issue:"
msgstr "重建字体信息缓存后，这些目录及其子目录中的字体即可立即使用。要手动触发重建，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:833
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% fc-cache\n"
msgstr "% fc-cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:839
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plenty of free, high quality fonts of both types are available in the ports "
"tree which can be readily used with X Window System.  This chapter provides "
"a brief overview of both, as well as configuring the X FreeType interface."
msgstr "Ports Collection 中提供了大量高质量免费字体，涵盖上述两种类型，可直接用于 X Window System。本章简要介绍这两类字体，以及 X FreeType 接口的配置方法。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:842
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For more information about how to install and configure fonts on FreeBSD, "
"please read the article link:{fonts}[Fonts and FreeBSD]."
msgstr "有关如何在 FreeBSD 上安装和配置字体的更多信息，请阅读文章 link:{fonts}[Fonts and FreeBSD]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:844
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "TrueType(R) Fonts"
msgstr "TrueType(R) 字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:850
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"X.org has built in support for rendering TrueType(R) fonts.  There are two "
"different modules that can enable this functionality.  The freetype module "
"is used in this example because it is more consistent with the other font "
"rendering back-ends.  To enable the freetype module just add the following "
"line to the `\"Module\"` section of [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf."
"d/90-fonts.conf#."
msgstr "X.org 内置了对 TrueType(R) 字体渲染的支持。有两个不同的模块可以启用此功能。本例使用 freetype 模块，因为它与其他字体渲染后端的行为更一致。要启用 freetype 模块，只需将以下行添加到 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/90-fonts.conf# 中的 `\"Module\"` 部分。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:854
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Load  \"freetype\"\n"
msgstr "Load  \"freetype\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:860
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now make a directory for the TrueType(R) fonts (for example, [.filename]#/"
"usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType#) and copy all of the TrueType(R) fonts into "
"this directory.  Keep in mind that TrueType(R) fonts cannot be directly "
"taken from an Apple(R) Mac(R); they must be in UNIX(R)/MS-DOS(R)/Windows(R) "
"format for use by X.org.  Once the files have been copied into this "
"directory, use mkfontscale to create a [.filename]#fonts.dir#, so that the X "
"font renderer knows that these new files have been installed.  `mkfontscale` "
"can be installed as a package:"
msgstr "现在为 TrueType(R) 字体创建一个目录（例如 [.filename]#/usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType#），并将所有 TrueType(R) 字体复制到该目录。请注意，不能直接使用从 Apple(R) Mac(R) 获取的 TrueType(R) 字体；X.org 使用的字体必须是 UNIX(R)/MS-DOS(R)/Windows(R) 格式。将文件复制到该目录后，使用 mkfontscale 创建 [.filename]#fonts.dir#，以便 X 字体渲染器识别这些新安装的文件。可以通过安装软件包来获取 `mkfontscale`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:864
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install mkfontscale\n"
msgstr "# pkg install mkfontscale\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:867
msgid "Then create an index of X font files in a directory:"
msgstr "然后在目录中建立X字体档的索引："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:872
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType\n"
"# mkfontscale\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType\n# mkfontscale\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:876
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now add the TrueType(R) directory to the font path.  This is just the same "
"as described in <<type1>>:"
msgstr "现在将 TrueType(R) 目录添加到字体路径中。方法与 <<type1>> 中所述相同："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:881
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% xset fp+ /usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType\n"
"% xset fp rehash\n"
msgstr "% xset fp+ /usr/local/share/fonts/TrueType\n% xset fp rehash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:884
#, fuzzy
msgid "or add a `FontPath` line to [.filename]#xorg.conf#."
msgstr "或者，在 [.filename]#xorg.conf# 中添加一行 `FontPath`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:887
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now Gimp, LibreOffice, and all of the other X applications should now "
"recognize the installed TrueType(R) fonts.  Extremely small fonts (as with "
"text in a high resolution display on a web page) and extremely large fonts "
"(within LibreOffice) will look much better now."
msgstr "现在，Gimp、LibreOffice 和其他所有 X 应用程序都应该能够识别已安装的 TrueType(R) 字体。现在，极小的字体（例如网页高分辨率显示中的文本）和极大的字体（例如 LibreOffice 中的字体）看起来都会好得多。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:889
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type1 Fonts"
msgstr "Type1字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:893
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The URW font collection (package:x11-fonts/urwfonts[]) includes high quality "
"versions of standard type1 fonts (Times Roman(TM), Helvetica(TM), "
"Palatino(TM) and others).  The Freefonts collection (package:x11-fonts/"
"freefonts[]) includes many more fonts, but most of them are intended for use "
"in graphics software such as the Gimp, and are not complete enough to serve "
"as screen fonts."
msgstr "URW 字体集合（package:x11-fonts/urwfonts[]）包含高质量的标准 type1 字体（Times Roman(TM)、Helvetica(TM)、Palatino(TM) 等）。Freefonts 字体集合（package:x11-fonts/freefonts[]）包含更多字体，但其中大多数用于 Gimp 等图形软件，不够完整，不适合作为屏幕字体。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:895
msgid ""
"To install the above Type1 font collections from binary packages, run the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "要由Binary套件安装上述的Type1字体集可执行以下指令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:899
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install urwfonts\n"
msgstr "# pkg install urwfonts\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:903
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"And likewise with the freefont or other collections.  To have a manually "
"configured X server detect these fonts, add an appropriate line to the X "
"server configuration file ([.filename]#/usr/local/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/90-"
"fonts.conf#), which reads:"
msgstr ""
"同样的安装方式也适用Freefont或其他字体集。要让X服务器侦测到这些新安装的字体，"
"可加入适当的设定到X服务器配置文件（<filename>/etc/X11/xorg.conf</"
"filename>），内容为："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:909
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Section \"Files\"\n"
"  FontPath \"/usr/local/share/fonts/urwfonts/\"\n"
"EndSection\n"
msgstr "FontPath \"/usr/local/share/fonts/urwfonts/\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:912
msgid "Alternatively, at the command line in the X session run:"
msgstr "或者在X session的指令列执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:917
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% xset fp+ /usr/local/share/fonts/urwfonts\n"
"% xset fp rehash\n"
msgstr "% xset fp+ /usr/local/share/fonts/urwfonts\n% xset fp rehash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:921
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will work but will be lost when the X session is closed, unless it is "
"added to the startup file ([.filename]#~/.xinitrc# for a normal `startx` "
"session, or [.filename]#~/.xsession# when logging in through a graphical "
"login manager like XDM).  A third way is to use the new [.filename]#/usr/"
"local/etc/fonts/local.conf# as demonstrated in <<antialias>>."
msgstr "这种方法有效，但关闭 X 会话后设置就会丢失，除非将其添加到启动文件中（普通 `startx` 会话使用 [.filename]#~/.xinitrc#，通过 XDM 等图形登录管理器登录时使用 [.filename]#~/.xsession#）。第三种方法是使用新的 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/fonts/local.conf#，如 <<antialias>> 所示。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:923
#, no-wrap
msgid "Anti-Aliased Fonts"
msgstr "抗锯齿字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:927
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All fonts in X.org that are found in [.filename]#/usr/local/share/fonts/# "
"and [.filename]#~/.fonts/# are automatically made available for anti-"
"aliasing to Xft-aware applications.  Most recent applications are Xft-aware, "
"including KDE, GNOME, and Firefox."
msgstr ""
"如同前面所提到的，所有在<filename>/usr/local/share/fonts/</filename>与"
"<filename>~/.fonts/</filename>的字体均可在Xft-aware的应用程序做反锯齿效果，若"
"您想要加入除了上两者以外的目录，可加入如下行设定到<filename>/usr/local/etc/"
"fonts/local.conf</filename>："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:931
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To control which fonts are anti-aliased, or to configure anti-aliasing "
"properties, create (or edit, if it already exists) the file [.filename]#/usr/"
"local/etc/fonts/local.conf#.  Several advanced features of the Xft font "
"system can be tuned using this file; this section describes only some simple "
"possibilities.  For more details, please see man:fonts-conf[5]."
msgstr "要控制哪些字体使用抗锯齿，或配置抗锯齿属性，请创建（如果已存在则编辑）文件 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/fonts/local.conf#。Xft 字体系统的若干高级功能都可以通过此文件调整；本节仅介绍一些简单的用法。有关更多详情，请参阅 man:fonts-conf[5]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:935
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This file must be in XML format.  Pay careful attention to case, and make "
"sure all tags are properly closed.  The file begins with the usual XML "
"header followed by a DOCTYPE definition, and then the `<fontconfig>` tag:"
msgstr "此文件必须采用 XML 格式。请仔细检查大小写，并确保所有标签都正确闭合。文件以常见的 XML 标头开头，接着是 DOCTYPE 定义，然后是 `<fontconfig>` 标签："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:941
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n"
"      <!DOCTYPE fontconfig SYSTEM \"fonts.dtd\">\n"
"      <fontconfig>\n"
msgstr "<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n      <!DOCTYPE fontconfig SYSTEM \"fonts.dtd\">\n      <fontconfig>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:945
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As previously stated, all fonts in [.filename]#/usr/local/share/fonts/# as "
"well as [.filename]#~/.fonts/# are already made available to Xft-aware "
"applications.  To add another directory outside of these two directory "
"trees, add a line like this to [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/fonts/local.conf#:"
msgstr ""
"如同前面所提到的，所有在<filename>/usr/local/share/fonts/</filename>与"
"<filename>~/.fonts/</filename>的字体均可在Xft-aware的应用程序做反锯齿效果，若"
"您想要加入除了上两者以外的目录，可加入如下行设定到<filename>/usr/local/etc/"
"fonts/local.conf</filename>："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:949
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "<dir>/path/to/my/fonts</dir>\n"
msgstr "<dir>/path/to/my/fonts</dir>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:952
msgid ""
"After adding new fonts, and especially new font directories, rebuild the "
"font caches:"
msgstr "加入新字体及额外的新字体目录之后，需重新建立字体缓存："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:956
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# fc-cache -f\n"
msgstr "# fc-cache -f\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:960
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Anti-aliasing makes borders slightly fuzzy, which makes very small text more "
"readable and removes \"staircases\" from large text, but can cause eyestrain "
"if applied to normal text.  To exclude font sizes smaller than 14 point from "
"anti-aliasing, include these lines:"
msgstr ""
"反锯齿效果会让文字的边缘变模糊，这会让非常小的文字更能阅读且去除大型文字的"
"<quote>锯齿</quote>，但套用在一般的文字可能会造成眼睛的疲劳。要排除小于14点的"
"字体大小使用反锯齿效果，可加入这些行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:979
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\t<match target=\"font\">\n"
"\t    <test name=\"size\" compare=\"less\">\n"
"\t\t<double>14</double>\n"
"\t    </test>\n"
"\t    <edit name=\"antialias\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t\t<bool>false</bool>\n"
"\t    </edit>\n"
"\t</match>\n"
"\t<match target=\"font\">\n"
"\t    <test name=\"pixelsize\" compare=\"less\" qual=\"any\">\n"
"\t\t<double>14</double>\n"
"\t    </test>\n"
"\t    <edit mode=\"assign\" name=\"antialias\">\n"
"\t\t<bool>false</bool>\n"
"\t    </edit>\n"
"\t</match>\n"
msgstr "\t<match target=\"font\">\n\t    <test name=\"size\" compare=\"less\">\n\t\t<double>14</double>\n\t    </test>\n\t    <edit name=\"antialias\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t\t<bool>false</bool>\n\t    </edit>\n\t</match>\n\t<match target=\"font\">\n\t    <test name=\"pixelsize\" compare=\"less\" qual=\"any\">\n\t\t<double>14</double>\n\t    </test>\n\t    <edit mode=\"assign\" name=\"antialias\">\n\t\t<bool>false</bool>\n\t    </edit>\n\t</match>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:985
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Spacing for some monospaced fonts might also be inappropriate with anti-"
"aliasing.  This seems to be an issue with KDE, in particular.  One possible "
"fix is to force the spacing for such fonts to be 100.  Add these lines:"
msgstr "某些等宽字体在启用抗锯齿后，字间距也可能不合适。尤其是 KDE 中似乎存在这个问题。一种可能的解决方法是将此类字体的间距强制设为 100。添加以下几行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1004
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t   <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t       <string>fixed</string>\n"
"\t   </test>\n"
"\t   <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t       <string>mono</string>\n"
"\t   </edit>\n"
"\t</match>\n"
"\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t    <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t\t<string>console</string>\n"
"\t    </test>\n"
"\t    <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t\t<string>mono</string>\n"
"\t    </edit>\n"
"\t</match>\n"
msgstr "\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n\t   <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n\t       <string>fixed</string>\n\t   </test>\n\t   <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t       <string>mono</string>\n\t   </edit>\n\t</match>\n\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n\t    <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n\t\t<string>console</string>\n\t    </test>\n\t    <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t\t<string>mono</string>\n\t    </edit>\n\t</match>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1007
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"(this aliases the other common names for fixed fonts as `\"mono\"`), and "
"then add:"
msgstr "（这会将其他常见的固定宽度字体名称映射为 `\"mono\"`），然后添加："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1018
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t     <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t\t <string>mono</string>\n"
"\t     </test>\n"
"\t     <edit name=\"spacing\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t\t <int>100</int>\n"
"\t     </edit>\n"
"\t </match>\n"
msgstr "\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n\t     <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n\t\t <string>mono</string>\n\t     </test>\n\t     <edit name=\"spacing\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t\t <int>100</int>\n\t     </edit>\n\t </match>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1024
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Certain fonts, such as Helvetica, may have a problem when anti-aliased.  "
"Usually this manifests itself as a font that seems cut in half vertically.  "
"At worst, it may cause applications to crash.  To avoid this, consider "
"adding the following to [.filename]#local.conf#:"
msgstr ""
"部份字体，如Helvetica，在使用反锯齿时可能会发生问题，通常会呈现像垂直切成两半"
"的字体，最差还可能会导致应用程序当掉。要避免这个问题，可考虑加入以下设定到"
"<filename>local.conf</filename>："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1035
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t     <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n"
"\t\t <string>Helvetica</string>\n"
"\t     </test>\n"
"\t     <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t\t <string>sans-serif</string>\n"
"\t     </edit>\n"
"\t </match>\n"
msgstr "\t<match target=\"pattern\" name=\"family\">\n\t     <test qual=\"any\" name=\"family\">\n\t\t <string>Helvetica</string>\n\t     </test>\n\t     <edit name=\"family\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t\t <string>sans-serif</string>\n\t     </edit>\n\t </match>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1039
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After editing [.filename]#local.conf#, make certain to end the file with the "
"`</fontconfig>` tag.  Not doing this will cause changes to be ignored."
msgstr "编辑 [.filename]#local.conf# 后，请务必在文件末尾添加 `</fontconfig>` 标签。若未添加此标签，所做更改将被忽略。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1042
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Users can add personalized settings by creating their own [.filename]#~/."
"config/fontconfig/fonts.conf#.  This file uses the same `XML` format "
"described above."
msgstr "用户可以创建自己的 [.filename]#~/.config/fontconfig/fonts.conf# 文件来添加个性化设置。此文件使用与上文所述相同的 `XML` 格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1046
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One last point: with an LCD screen, sub-pixel sampling may be desired.  This "
"basically treats the (horizontally separated) red, green and blue components "
"separately to improve the horizontal resolution; the results can be "
"dramatic.  To enable this, add the line somewhere in [.filename]#local.conf#:"
msgstr ""
"最后一点：若有使用LCD屏幕，可能会想要使用子像素取样（Sub-pixel sampling），这"
"基本上会分开处理（水平分隔）红、绿、蓝色彩组成来提高垂直分辨率，结果可能是无"
"法预料的。要开启这个功能，加入下行到<filename>local.conf</filename>的任一处："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/x11/_index.adoc:1057
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\t <match target=\"font\">\n"
"\t     <test qual=\"all\" name=\"rgba\">\n"
"\t\t <const>unknown</const>\n"
"\t     </test>\n"
"\t     <edit name=\"rgba\" mode=\"assign\">\n"
"\t\t <const>rgb</const>\n"
"\t     </edit>\n"
"\t </match>\n"
msgstr "\t <match target=\"font\">\n\t     <test qual=\"all\" name=\"rgba\">\n\t\t <const>unknown</const>\n\t     </test>\n\t     <edit name=\"rgba\" mode=\"assign\">\n\t\t <const>rgb</const>\n\t     </edit>\n\t </match>\n"

